      ≤ n ≤ 14?, MathOverflow question 514742, August 2026.
      <a href="https://mathoverflow.net/q/514742">mathoverflow.net</a>; code,
      logs, and certificates at
      <a href="https://github.com/keithadler/square-achievement-game"
        >github.com/keithadler/square-achievement-game</a
      >
    </li>
  </ol>
</Base>
